# Architect checkpoint A review package

## Scope and source change

Tasks A1-A3 only are represented here. The only production-file change is `core/pit_optimizer_v5/production_runtime.py`.

The investigator now keeps the existing four per-episode headline metrics, then projects a closed ordered tuple of entry-funnel integer counts from the authenticated selected scenario. Projection occurs before archive or historical evidence. It emits `episode.{ordinal}.entry.{source_metric_id}`, omits absent metrics, and does not relax provider validation or alter any role input, schema, evaluator, or historical request.

All source lines remain CRLF. The exact preimage is `production_runtime.py.preimage`; `scoped-diff.patch` is its narrow diff against the final source.

