The preview authenticates the complete actual06 manifest graph through `authenticate_campaign_manifest_v5`, then uses `LocalArtifactRepositoryV5`, the existing recovery reducer, selected baseline parent, and `LocalRoleRequestFactoryV5`. It is saved as `future-investigator-request.json` and is explicitly future/unexecuted.

